    "title": "Shane Steichen: Week 3 final update, Colts vs. Texans - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Head coach Shane Steichen rules out wide receiver Ashton Dulin for Week 3 against the Houston Texans. Steichen then breaks down Texans tight end Dalton Schultz's style of play, and how facing a dominant tight end in Week 2 (Travis Kelce) can help the Colts defense prepare for Schultz. Finally, he shares how the Colts need to attack the run game against a dominant Texans defense with Will Anderson Jr. and Danielle Hunter. Read full article",
